#. 【例の殺人鬼】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[certain murderous fiend]"
msgstr ""

#. 例の殺人鬼って…
#. 不二咲さん、犯人に心当たりでもあるの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"A murderous fiend... Chihiro, do you have some idea\n"
"who might be behind all this?"
msgstr ""

#. 心当たりって言うか…
#. ひょっとしたらって程度なんだけど…
msgctxt "0003 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Well...maybe. I mean, I can't really be certain,\n"
"but..."
msgstr ""

#. この際、程度は問題じゃない！　発言を許可するっ！
msgctxt "0004 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Certainty is not a concern right now! I'll allow\n"
"whatever remarks you may have!"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…あのね…
msgctxt "0005 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "O-Okay, well..."
msgstr ""

#. みんな…<CLT 3>“ジェノサイダー翔”<CLT>って知ってる？
msgctxt "0006 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Have you guys heard of <CLT 3>Genocide Jack<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. それって…！
#. ネットとかテレビで話題になってる連続殺人犯の！？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You mean that serial killer that's been in the news\n"
"and all over the Internet?"
msgstr ""

#. 猟奇的かつ残忍な手口で殺人を繰り返す、
#. 凶悪殺人鬼…
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The monstrous villain who's murdered scores of victims\n"
"in brutally bizarre fashion..."
msgstr ""

#. 現場には必ず被害者本人の血で
#. <CLT 3>“チミドロフィーバー”<CLT>の血文字を残す。
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The word \"<CLT 3>bloodlust<CLT>\" was left at each murder scene,\n"
"written in the victim's own blood."
msgstr ""

#. 通り魔的かつ無差別的で突発的な犯行ばかりゆえ、
#. 警察もその足取りを掴めていない状態…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Whoever it is, he's like a ghost. He strikes without\n"
"warning, and disappears without a trace."
msgstr ""

#. そんな連続殺人事件の容疑者に、
#. ネット上で与えられたあだ名が…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And on the Internet, they started calling him..."
msgstr ""

#. ジェノサイダー翔…だったな？
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Genocide Jack. That about covers it, I think."
msgstr ""

#. 噂では、犠牲者は数千人にも及ぶって話だべ。
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "They say he's claimed over a thousand victims..."
msgstr ""

#. それって都市伝説でしょ？
#. せいぜい数十人とか…それでも異常だけど。
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"That's just an urban legend though, right? I mean even\n"
"like, ten people would be totally insane."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. とにかく…常軌を逸した殺人鬼らしいけど…
msgctxt "0016 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, whoever Genocide Jack really is, he's\n"
"obviously some kind of super crazy killer."
msgstr ""

#. そんな超ド級の変態殺人鬼なら…
#. こんな事を仕組んだとしても不思議じゃねーってか…
msgctxt "0017 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"And if he really is this \"ultimate\" psycho, I wouldn't\n"
"be surprised if he put together something like this."
msgstr ""

#. でも、確証はないって言うか…
#. ただの推論だけど…
msgctxt "0018 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"But like I said, I can't be certain. I don't have any\n"
"evidence or anything. It's just a thought..."
msgstr ""

#. つーか、そんなヤツが犯人だとしたら…
#. ものっそいクリミナルな問題じゃね？
msgctxt "0019 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"But if they're the killer, isn't that like a killer of\n"
"a problem for us!?"
msgstr ""

#. 大丈夫だって！　
#. 絶対に完璧に間違いなく大丈夫だって！
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It's okay! Everything's absolutely, positively, one\n"
"hundred percent without a doubt gonna be okay!"
msgstr ""

#. だってさ、もうすぐ助けも来るんだし！
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Cuz help's gonna be here soon, I'm sure of it!"
msgstr ""

#. は？　助け…？
msgctxt "0022 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh...? H-Help?"
msgstr ""

#. だってさ、私達がここに閉じ込められてから、
#. もう数日経つんだよ…
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We've been stuck in here a few days already, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 急に連絡の取れなくなった私達を心配して、
#. そろそろ警察も動き出す頃なんじゃない？
msgctxt "0024 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Nobody's been able to contact us, so I'm sure they're\n"
"getting worried. I bet they called the police already!"
msgstr ""

#. …アハハハハハハハハハハハハハハハッ！！
msgctxt "0025 | NO NAME"
msgid "AHHH-HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!"
msgstr ""

#. 警察だって…！　警察なんかあてにしてんの？
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "The police? You're putting your faith in the police!?"
msgstr ""

#. 現れたか…！
msgctxt "0027 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "What are you doing here!?"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラ…警察にはどんな役割があるか知ってる？
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You guys, seriously... Do you understand what role the\n"
"police exist to fill?"
msgstr ""

#. 引き立て役だよ。
#. 悪の組織や悪役やダークヒーローの。
msgctxt "0029 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"All they're good for is being a foil, playing against\n"
"a villain or anti-hero or evil organization."
msgstr ""

#. あいつらがやられる事で、
#. 悪役が引き立てられんの。
msgctxt "0030 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"The bad guys come along and destroy them, and that\n"
"shows just how badass they really are."
msgstr ""

#. そんな安直な役割しかない警察をあてにするなど、
#. お約束と言えども、どうかと思いますぞ。
msgctxt "0031 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you wanna rely on such an unreliable\n"
"group of losers?"
msgstr ""

#. …ていうかさぁ、そんなに出たいなら、
#. 殺しちゃえばいいじゃーん！
msgctxt "0032 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I mean come on! If you really, REALLY wanna get out of\n"
"here, all you gotta do is kill!"
msgstr ""

#. アッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0033 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. 笑うトコ？
msgctxt "0034 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Why the hell are you laughing?"
msgstr ""

#. 徹底した芝居っぷりに感心してるんよ。
msgctxt "0035 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'm just impressed at the total commitment to this\n"
"whole act."
msgstr ""

#. …アンタ、まだ言ってんの？
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "...You're still going on about that?"
msgstr ""

#. つーか何の用だぁ！？　連続殺人鬼さんよぉ！
msgctxt "0037 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"So, mister serial killer psycho freak bastard...what\n"
"the hell do you want!?"
msgstr ""

#. …レンゾクサツジンキー？
#. 変な名前！　ドイツ人？
msgctxt "0038 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Mr. Serialkillerpsychofreakbastard, huh? That's a\n"
"pretty long name! German, maybe?"
msgstr ""

#. オメェの正体はわかってんだよ…！
msgctxt "0039 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "We know who you really are!"
msgstr ""

#. 無視無視…
msgctxt "0040 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Maybe if I ignore him, he'll just go away..."
msgstr ""

#. 無視すんな、コラァ！！
msgctxt "0041 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Hey! Don't ignore me, asshole!"
msgstr ""

#. はいはい、それでは話を戻して…
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Okay, okay, let's get back to business."
msgstr ""

#. 学園生活が開始されて数日経った訳ですが、
#. まだ、誰かを殺すようなヤツは現われないよね！
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Your life here has already begun and a couple days\n"
"have gone by, and nobody's killing anybody!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラ、ゆとり世代の割にはガッツあるんだね…
#. でも、ボク的にはちょっと退屈ですぅ～！
msgctxt "0044 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I thought all you kids were lazy and selfish, and here\n"
"you are working together. But I'm totally bored!"
msgstr ""

#. な、何を言われたって…
#. ボクらは…人を殺したりなんか…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's nothing you can say that'll make us start\n"
"killing each other..."
msgstr ""

#. あ、わかった！　ピコーン、閃いたのだ！
msgctxt "0046 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Wait, I think—yes! Ding ding ding! I figured it out!"
msgstr ""

#. 場所も人も環境も、ミステリー要素は揃ってるのに、
#. どうして殺人が起きないのかと思ったら…
msgctxt "0047 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"All the mystery ingredients are here—right people,\n"
"right place. So why hasn't anyone killed anyone yet?"
msgstr ""

#. そっか、足りないものが１つあったね！！
msgctxt "0048 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's what I couldn't understand. But I just realized\n"
"there was one very important piece missing!"
msgstr ""

#. た、足りないものって、なんだよ…
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What are you...?"
msgstr ""

#. …ずばり“動機”だよ！
msgctxt "0050 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "If you wanna know, I'll tell ya! It's motive!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ、だったら簡単！
#. ボクがみんなに<CLT 3>“動機”<CLT>を与えればいいだけだもんね！
msgctxt "0051 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu! It's so simple! I just have to give everyone a\n"
"<CLT 3>motive<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 動機だぁ…？　どういう意味だッ！！
msgctxt "0052 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Motive? What the fuck are you talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. ところでさ、オマエラに見せたい物があるんだ！
msgctxt "0053 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Oh, by the way! There's something I wanna show you\n"
"guys!"
msgstr ""

#. 話変えんな、コラァァ！！
msgctxt "0054 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Stop changing the goddamn subject!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラに見せたいのは、
#. ちょっとした映像だよ…
msgctxt "0055 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I have a little video I'd like you all to see."
msgstr ""

#. あ、違うよ。１８禁とかアブノーマルとかじゃないよ！
#. ホントに、そういうのじゃないんだからッ！！
msgctxt "0056 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Oh, but don't worry. It's not some pervy \"adult\" video\n"
"or anything. Seriously, it's nothing like that!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>学園の外の映像<CLT>なんだってば！
msgctxt "0057 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It's a special video for each of you showing what's\n"
"going on <CLT 3>outside the school<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 学園の外の…なんの映像だよ…
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Outside the school...? What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. ヘヘッ、ダンナも気が短けぇや！
#. そいつは見てのお楽しみじゃねーですかッ！
msgctxt "0059 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Heh-heh! Ooh, Master's so impatient today! Why don't\n"
"you just watch it and find out?"
msgstr ""

#. なんでも、学校内の<CLT 3>“ある場所”<CLT>に行けば、
#. その映像が見られるようになってるらしいですゼッ！
msgctxt "0060 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Here in the school, there's a <CLT 3>specific place<CLT> you can\n"
"go that has everything you need to watch the video."
msgstr ""

#. …だったら、すぐに確認してみましょう。
msgctxt "0061 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Good, then we can go watch the video right now."
msgstr ""

#. でも、その前に聞かせてもらえる？
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But before we do that, I'd like to know..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたは何者なの？　
#. どうしてこんな事をするの？
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What are you? Why would you do something like this?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたは私達に何をさせたいの？
msgctxt "0064 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What do you want from us?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクがオマエラに…させたい事？
msgctxt "0065 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What do I want from you...?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、それはね…
msgctxt "0066 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Well, if you must know..."
msgstr ""

#. 絶望…それだけだよ……
msgctxt "0067 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Despair. That's all."
msgstr ""

#. 後の事が知りたければ、
#. オマエラが自分達の手で突き止めるんだね。
msgctxt "0068 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If you want to know more than that, you'll have to\n"
"figure it out for yourselves."
msgstr ""

#. この学園に潜む謎…知りたければ好きにして。
#. ボクは止めないよ。
msgctxt "0069 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Do whatever you need to to uncover the mystery hidden\n"
"within this school. I won't try and stop you."
msgstr ""

#. だって、オマエラが必死に真実を探し求める姿も、
#. 面白い見世物だしさッ！
msgctxt "0070 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Cuz to be honest, it's entertaining as heck watching\n"
"you guys search so desperately for answers!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクも楽しませてもーらおっと！
msgctxt "0071 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So I guess I want amusement from you, too."
msgstr ""

#. 行っちゃいました…ね…
msgctxt "0072 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "He's gone..."
msgstr ""

#. それに今回も…
#. 結局、何も聞けず終いで…
msgctxt "0073 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"And once again, he left before we could find out\n"
"anything useful."
msgstr ""

#. そう…？　いい事を聞けたじゃない。
msgctxt "0074 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Really? I think we learned something *very* useful."
msgstr ""

#. 真実を追い求めるのは自由。
#. あいつはそれを止めはしない…なるほどね。
msgctxt "0075 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He has no intention of standing in the way of our\n"
"pursuit of the truth. Interesting..."
msgstr ""

#. されど…学園の外の映像とは何の事だ？
#. 気に掛かるな…
msgctxt "0076 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Perhaps, but what about the video he mentioned? I'm\n"
"very curious to see what's on it."
msgstr ""

#. よぉし！　じゃあ、ここは…！
msgctxt "0077 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Same here! Okay, so...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大和田クンはぐるりと
#. 食堂内を見回したかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mondo started glancing around the dining hall...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その視線は、ボクに向けられたところで止まった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...but when his gaze landed on me, he stopped.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おう、苗木！　ちっと調べてみてくれや！
msgctxt "0080 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Hey Makoto! Check this out for us, would ya?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ？　なんでボクが…！？
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Why me!?"
msgstr ""

#. オメェが扉の近くに立ってるからだ。
#. 決まりだろ？
msgctxt "0082 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Cuz you're closest to the door! That's the rule,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. き、決まりだって…
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "R-Rule...?"
msgstr ""

#. おいおい…
msgctxt "0084 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Hey, hey..."
msgstr ""

#. おいおいおいおいおいおいおいおい…
msgctxt "0085 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Hey hey hey hey hey!"
msgstr ""

#. うぉぉぉい！！
msgctxt "0086 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "HEEEEEY!!!"
msgstr ""

#. オレがこうやって頼んでんだ！
#. ちっと調べるくらい簡単に出来るだろうがよぉ！！
msgctxt "0087 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"You see how passionately I'm begging you!? What's the\n"
"big deal? Just check it out real quick!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. わ、わかったよ…じゃあ行ってくる…
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay...I guess I'll get going, then."
msgstr ""

#. おぅ、すまねぇな！　恩に着るぜ！
msgctxt "0090 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Awesome, thanks! I owe ya one!"
msgstr ""

#. …だったら、私も行きます。
#. １人だと危険じゃないですか。
msgctxt "0091 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"...If Makoto's going, I'm going with him. It's not\n"
"safe to walk around this place alone."
msgstr ""

#. そっか、わーったよ。
#. じゃあ、２人とも頼むぜ！
msgctxt "0092 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure thing. Then we're countin' on the both of\n"
"ya!"
msgstr ""

#. 何かあったら助けを呼べよ。
#. ソッコーでオレが駆けつけてやっからよ！
msgctxt "0093 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "If anything happens, just yell and I'll come runnin'!"
msgstr ""

#. よーし、みんな集まったな！
#. では、さっそく朝食会を始めるとしようかッ！
msgctxt "0094 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Okay, looks like everyone's here. So then, let's begin\n"
"our very first \"breakfast meeting\"!"
msgstr ""

#. 諸君、わざわざ集まってくれてありがとう！！
msgctxt "0095 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Everyone, thank you for making time in your busy\n"
"schedules to come together."
msgstr ""

#. 断ったのに、オメーが無理矢理、
#. 連れて来たんじゃん…
msgctxt "0096 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "I didn't make time for shit. You dragged me here..."
msgstr ""

#. さっきも話したと思うが…
msgctxt "0097 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I know I already mentioned this earlier, but..."
msgstr ""

#. ここから脱出する為には、
#. 僕らが一層互いに協力し合う事が必要不可欠だ！
msgctxt "0098 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"In order to get out of here, it is essential that we\n"
"all cooperate with each other."
msgstr ""

#. その第一歩として、仲間同士の信頼を築き上げる為の
#. 朝食会を開催する事と相成った！
msgctxt "0099 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"And the first step is this breakfast meeting, to allow\n"
"us to become friends and build trust!"
msgstr ""

#. これからは、朝の起床を知らせる校内放送後、
#. この食堂に集まるように、よろしく頼むぞ！！
msgctxt "0100 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"So from now on, let's all meet here in the dining hall\n"
"every morning after the morning announcement!"
msgstr ""

#. では、さっそく朝食を頂くとしようではないかッ！
msgctxt "0101 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Now then, let's eat!"
msgstr ""

#. 他人と朝食を食べるの…？
#. き、緊張するわ…そんなの初めてよ…
msgctxt "0102 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You w-want me to eat breakfast with other p-people?\n"
"I've never done that b-before. I'm not s-sure..."
msgstr ""

#. 久しぶりですらねーんだ…
msgctxt "0103 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Yeah, it's been a while for me, too."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、そんな事よりさ…
#. あれから手掛かりを掴んだヤツはいないの？
msgctxt "0104 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Well anyway...did anyone happen to come up with any\n"
"clues?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>食堂に、シーンという擬音が響き渡った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Silence echoed throughout the dining hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. マジで！？　なんも進展なしッ！？
msgctxt "0106 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Seriously? Nothing at all!?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人に関してでも、逃げ道に関してでもいいから、
#. 誰か、なんかないのッ！？
msgctxt "0107 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Anything, it can be about how to get out, or who's\n"
"doing this, nobody has anything!?"
msgstr ""

#. …死にますわよ。
msgctxt "0108 | CELES"
msgid "...You are going to die."
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0109 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 他人の前で弱みを見せているようですと…
msgctxt "0110 | CELES"
msgid ""
"If you can't stop yourself from showing weakness in\n"
"front of others..."
msgstr ""

#. あなた死にますわよ…
msgctxt "0111 | CELES"
msgid "...you will die."
msgstr ""

#. ア、アンタ何言ってんの！？
#. 死ぬとか……ふざけないでっ！！
msgctxt "0112 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Wh-What the hell? Don't even freaking joke about that!"
msgstr ""

#. 言いましたわよね？
#. 『適応力こそ生命力である』と…
msgctxt "0113 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I am not joking. Adaptability is survivability. Did I\n"
"not say so?"
msgstr ""

#. 早く、ここの生活に慣れるべきですわ。
msgctxt "0114 | CELES"
msgid ""
"So you'd better hurry up and adapt to your new life\n"
"here."
msgstr ""

#. アンタ…頭おかしいんじゃない？
#. ここに慣れろとか…何言ってんの…？
msgctxt "0115 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Have you gone completely insane? Adapt to my new life\n"
"here? Do you have any idea what you're saying?"
msgstr ""

#. その女はここで暮らしたいらしいな？
#. だったら好きにさせとけ。
msgctxt "0116 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, sounds like the girl wants to live here. And\n"
"hell, more power to her."
msgstr ""

#. だけどなぁ…
msgctxt "0117 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "But shit..."
msgstr ""

#. オレはゴメンだ！
#. ぜってー出て行くぞ…！
msgctxt "0118 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"No way in hell am I living here! I'm gettin' outta\n"
"here, I don't give a shit!"
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、ではお好きに。
msgctxt "0119 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhm. Sure, feel free."
msgstr ""

#. で…手掛かりは何もねーの？
msgctxt "0120 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Okay, so...nobody has any clues?"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人なら決まってるよ。
#. よっぽど異常で猟奇的なヤツなんだよ。
msgctxt "0121 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"One thing I can tell you is who's behind all this.\n"
"Someone who's totally weird and messed up."
msgstr ""

#. じゃなきゃ、私達をこんな所に
#. 閉じ込めたりしないもん…
msgctxt "0122 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Why else would we be trapped in here in the first\n"
"place?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな感想的な事はどーでもいいから、
#. 実際のところ、手掛かりは…
msgctxt "0123 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Well, sure, it could be something like that. But for\n"
"right now, actual clues are..."
msgstr ""

#. あ…あのぉ……
msgctxt "0124 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "U-Umm..."
msgstr ""

#. …あんっ？　何？
msgctxt "0125 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Huh? What's up?"
msgstr ""

#. 異常で猟奇的な犯人って線から…
#. 考えるとさぁ…
msgctxt "0126 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"If you think in terms of people who are really\n"
"abnormal or bizarre..."
msgstr ""

#. ひょっとして、犯人って…
#. <CLT 1>【例の殺人鬼】<CLT>だったりしないよね…？
msgctxt "0127 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Do you think maybe the person responsible for all this\n"
"could be a <CLT 1>[certain murderous fiend]<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲くんに何か意見があるようだな！
#. 確かめてみてはどうだろう！？
msgctxt "0128 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Sounds like you've got one heck of a thought, Chihiro!\n"
"Let's dig into it!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0129 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>めんどくさそうに、ため息をつかれた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He let out a heavy, annoyed sigh.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか無視されるより堪える…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd rather be ignored completely than suffer that kind\n"
"of insult.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 例の殺人鬼…
#. まさか…あれの事か？
msgctxt "0132 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"When you say a \"certain murderous fiend,\" you're\n"
"talking about...him, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. おう、苗木。
msgctxt "0133 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Yo."
msgstr ""

#. おはよう…
msgctxt "0134 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Good morning..."
msgstr ""

#. とっとと朝食会っての始めるぞ…
#. 石丸の野郎が待ち構えてるしな…
msgctxt "0135 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Let's just hurry up and get this over with. Taka's\n"
"getting antsy."
msgstr ""

#. あの女、何考えてやがんだ？
#. こんなとこで暮らすなんて冗談じゃねーぜ…
msgctxt "0136 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"What's with that chick? Living in a place like this?\n"
"Gimme a break..."
msgstr ""

#. オメェもそうだろ、苗木…
msgctxt "0137 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "You know what I'm sayin'?"
msgstr ""

#. オレに話してどーすんだよッ！
#. 仕切ってんのは風紀委員だっつーの…
msgctxt "0138 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"What are you looking at me for? Mr. Goody Two Shoes is\n"
"running the show for now."
msgstr ""

#. おいおーい…
#. 殺人鬼って…どーゆー事？
msgctxt "0139 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "What do you mean by \"murderous fiend\"?"
msgstr ""

#. おはようございますですぞ…
msgctxt "0140 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Good morning..."
msgstr ""

#. 山田クン…
#. なんだが、テンション低いね？
msgctxt "0141 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hifumi...? You don't seem too energetic..."
msgstr ""

#. そりゃ、下がりますよ…
#. あんな暑苦しい男に起こされるなんて…悪夢だ…
msgctxt "0142 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"How can I be? I got woke up by that annoying,\n"
"obnoxious, nightmarish guy..."
msgstr ""

#. これだから３次元は…
msgctxt "0143 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "This is why I hate 3D so much."
msgstr ""

#. さ、殺人鬼でございますですか？
msgctxt "0144 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Do you know anything about this \"murderous fiend\"?"
msgstr ""

#. そそそ、そんな使い古されたネタなんて
#. 今時ないないッ！　流行りませんぞッ！
msgctxt "0145 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"But I mean, s-s-seriously, isn't that like super\n"
"played out? No way they're gonna show up here!"
msgstr ""

#. おう、おはようーさん。
msgctxt "0146 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Mornin'."
msgstr ""

#. しっかし、朝一番に石丸っちの声はきつかったな…
#. 爽やかな空気と一番縁遠いべ…
msgctxt "0147 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Man, waking up to the sound of Taka's squawking\n"
"is...not a fun way to start the day."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんか…
#. 聞いてはいけない単語が聞こえたような気が…
msgctxt "0148 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Y'know, I think I just heard something I really didn't\n"
"wanna hear..."
msgstr ""

#. さ、さつ…じ…？
msgctxt "0149 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "M-Murderous...?"
msgstr ""

#. おはようございます、苗木君。
msgctxt "0150 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Good morning to you, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さすがアイドルだよな…
#. なんかもう、挨拶の爽やかさレベルが違うよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She can make even a basic greeting feel eloquent\n"
"somehow. That's the power of a celebrity, I guess.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうかしました？
msgctxt "0152 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Is everything okay?"
msgstr ""

#. う、ううん！
#. おはよう、舞園さん。
msgctxt "0153 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Oh, yeah! Good morning, Sayaka."
msgstr ""

#. 適応力こそ生命力…ですか…
msgctxt "0154 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Adaptability is survivability...?"
msgstr ""

#. セレスさんは…どうして…
#. あんな風に思えるんでしょうね…
msgctxt "0155 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "How can she think like that...?"
msgstr ""

#. …石丸君がお待ちかねよ。
#. 早く始めましょう…
msgctxt "0156 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Taka looks pretty impatient. We'd better get this\n"
"started already..."
msgstr ""

#. 殺人鬼…ね…
msgctxt "0157 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "A murderous fiend, huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 詳しい事、聞いてみた方がいいんじゃない？
msgctxt "0158 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I think it'd be very useful to get some more details\n"
"about that."
msgstr ""

#. おっはよー、苗木！
msgctxt "0159 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Good-mor-ning-Ma-ko-to!"
msgstr ""

#. おはよう…
msgctxt "0160 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Morning..."
msgstr ""

#. あっさごっはんー、あっさごはんー！
#. 朝はちゃんと食べないとね！
msgctxt "0161 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Breakfast time! Breakfast time! Gotta eat a big\n"
"breakfast at breakfast time!"
msgstr ""

#. え、えぇぇぇぇ！？　殺人鬼？
msgctxt "0162 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Whaaaaaaaaaaat!? A murderous fiend!?"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲ちゃんに詳しい事、聞いてみようよ！
msgctxt "0163 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We should ask Chihiro more about it!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしに話しかけて…
#. どうするのよ…
msgctxt "0164 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What's the point of t-talking to me...?"
msgstr ""

#. 石丸が呼んだんだから…
#. あいつに話しかければいいじゃない…
msgctxt "0165 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Taka's the o-one who got everyone t-together. Go talk\n"
"to him if you have qu-questions or whatever..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0166 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 腐川さん？
msgctxt "0167 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Toko...?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うるさいわね…！
#. 不二咲に聞けばいいでしょ、殺人鬼の事なんて…
msgctxt "0168 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Sh-Shut up! If you wanna kn-know about that murderous\n"
"f-fiend or whatever, t-talk to Chihiro!"
msgstr ""

#. おはよう…
msgctxt "0169 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr ""

#. お、おはよう…
msgctxt "0170 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "G-Good morning..."
msgstr ""

#. こうして、みなそろって朝食会とはな…
#. 石丸らしい発案だが…
msgctxt "0171 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"To bring everyone together for a breakfast meeting is\n"
"a very...Taka-esque suggestion."
msgstr ""

#. 連続殺人鬼…
#. このところ世間を騒がせているニュースだな…
msgctxt "0172 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"News of a brutal serial killer has been terrorizing\n"
"the world for some time now."
msgstr ""

#. 詳しい事は、我は知らぬが…
msgctxt "0173 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I don't really know the details, though."
msgstr ""

#. 朝食会、ですか…
msgctxt "0174 | CELES"
msgid "A breakfast meeting, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. みなさんとの円滑な生活には
#. 悪くない催し物かもしれませんね。
msgctxt "0175 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Perhaps it will keep me entertained and make life with\n"
"everyone here a bit more bearable."
msgstr ""

#. 嫌ですわね…
#. 食事中には相応しくない話題です…
msgctxt "0176 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I hate this... This topic is absolutely NOT\n"
"appropriate during mealtime!"
msgstr ""

#. はいはい、あたしと話してるヒマあったら
#. とっとと朝食会始めるわよ！
msgctxt "0177 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, if I absolutely MUST talk to you, let's\n"
"just hurry up and start the stupid meeting!"
msgstr ""

#. 石丸が待ち構えてんだしさァ…
msgctxt "0178 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Taka's gonna throw a fit if we don't."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと！
#. 殺人鬼って…冗談になってないんだけど！
msgctxt "0179 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Come on! A \"murderous fiend\"? Don't even joke about\n"
"something like that!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな話より、
#. どーやって脱出するか考えようって！
msgctxt "0180 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"And anyway, we need to figure out how to get the hell\n"
"out of here!"
msgstr ""

#. おはようございますぅ…
msgctxt "0181 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Good morning..."
msgstr ""

#. おはよう、不二咲さん。
msgctxt "0182 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Good morning, Chihiro."
msgstr ""

#. みんなでご飯って、いいねぇ…
#. やっぱり大勢で食べる方が楽しいよね。
msgctxt "0183 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"It's nice to get to eat with everyone... With so many\n"
"people, it's actually kind of fun."
msgstr ""

#. あ…あのぉ……
msgctxt "0184 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "U-Umm..."
msgstr ""

#. 異常で猟奇的な犯人って線から
#. 考えるとさぁ…
msgctxt "0185 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"If you think in terms of people who are really\n"
"abnormal or bizarre..."
msgstr ""

#. ひょっとして、犯人って…
#. <CLT 1>【例の殺人鬼】<CLT>だったりしないよね…？
msgctxt "0186 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Do you think maybe the person responsible for all this\n"
"could be a <CLT 1>[certain murderous fiend]<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、このモニター…！
#. どこの会社が作ってるんだよ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0187 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What kind of monitor is this!? Who would even make\n"
"this kind of thing!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …モノクマ社って書いてある。
#. ディティールにこだわってんな…
msgctxt "0188 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It has \"Monokuma Co.\" written across it. I guess\n"
"they've covered all the details..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつでもどこでも…
#. このカメラでボクらを監視しているんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0189 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anywhere we go, day or night... This thing is watching\n"
"us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間さえも正しいのかわからない。
#. もう何を信じていいのやら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0190 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't even be sure if that clock is right. I don't\n"
"know what to believe anymore...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いま出ていっても意味がない…
#. 目の前の相手に話しかけよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0191 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no reason to leave right now. I should talk to\n"
"everyone that's here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いま出ていっても意味がない…
#. 目の前の相手に話しかけよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0192 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no reason to leave right now. I should talk to\n"
"everyone that's here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
